@SmartInventory.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5209

### Health check - get all products
GET {{SmartInventory.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Login and get JWT token
POST {{SmartInventory.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin_password_here"
}

###

### Register a new user
POST {{SmartInventory.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "newuser",
    "email": "newuser@example.com",
    "password": "Test@123456",
    "fullName": "New User"
}